# Build output and vendored trees. Prettier does not read `.gitignore`, so the
# generated ones have to be repeated here — `src-tauri/gen/` in particular only
# exists after a `tauri dev` or `tauri build`, which is exactly the shape of bug
# `npm run check` is meant not to have: green on a clean CI checkout and red for
# everyone who has actually run the app.
dist/
node_modules/
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/

# Lockfiles are the package manager's format, not ours.
package-lock.json
src-tauri/Cargo.lock

# Rust has its own formatter; see `src-tauri/rustfmt.toml`.
*.rs

# Markdown is left alone on purpose, and for two separate reasons.
#
# `docs/` is hand-set prose: Prettier rewrites `*emphasis*` to `_emphasis_` and
# repads every table, which is several hundred lines of diff that says nothing
# about the documents.
#
# `examples/Ashfall.wobu/` is not prose at all — it is a project folder in
# Wobu's own on-disk format, read off disk by the `wobu-influence` and
# `wobu-store` fixture tests. A formatter is the wrong tool for a file whose
# layout is the thing under test.
*.md
